  "notes": "Dark near-black analysis workspace for an ML speech data review meeting. Signature: a huge canvas-rendered embedding scatter (blue-grey clouds of points) where the flagged regression region glows orange inside a dashed ellipse (A, orange) and a comparison cluster gets a solid light-blue ellipse (B, blue); A/B lettered circle tokens carry through the compare table, bar charts, region chips and saved-region rows. Cluster labels use mono ids ('C-141 en-NG · street'). Diverging teal→orange→red ramp for WER change. Audio player shows waveform plus reference/v41/v42 transcript with word-level error highlights (substitution boxes, strikethrough deletions) and WER pills. Meeting framing: stepper of review stages, countdown 'left of 60 min', attendee avatars. Keyboard hints on buttons (D for Draw region, F fly to flagged, 0 show all). Single amber-yellow (#ffe08a) primary CTA. Codebook gap filed: transcript-diff overlay for media-player."
